# Name Authority Files and Humanities Database Searching.

**Authors:** Spink, Amanda, Leatherbury, Maurice

## Abstract
Examines whether the Library of Congress Name Authority File (LCNAF) could enhance retrieval during individual name searching of humanities databases. Results demonstrate that the LCNAF has utility in name searching of humanities databases, and it could provide the humanities scholar and search intermediary with authoritative information about the sought-after names before online interaction. (AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ534423

